# default in its reader (src/quest/sentinel/quest_config.cpp) and in its struct (quest_config.h, the value with no file), the key read and dropped,
# the key's name, the key dropped from KnownSections (src/core/nevr_config.cpp, so the file's key is counted unknown), an integer key's range ends,
# combat.force, and the rules of ReadCombatText and ReadCombatInt. Judged by quest_config_test (build/quest-host-shared). All three files are shared:
# run this list in a scratch copy of the tree (git archive), never in the shared checkout, or hold the port2 shared lock for the whole run. Sourced by
# ../mutants.sh, which defines `runm <name> <file> <sed> [<dir> <target>]`.
